<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1496) <span class="when">Oct 13, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>A shorter menu bar.</b> Compare is now <b>View ▸ Compare</b>, and the Notes menu's items are in <b>Review</b>. Every shortcut is the key it was.</li>
<li>Playback: loop items are under <b>Loop</b>; ⌘I is View ▸ Readouts ▸ Clip Info; Keyboard Shortcuts (⌘/) is in Help.</li>
<li>Checkboxes throughout the app are drawn in Asobi's own style: a small box, crossed when on.</li>
</ul>
